WEBVTT

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:08.020
Akari!

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:10.220
In preparation for this
deserving-to-be-commemorated episode,

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:12.460
I've put together some gorgeous clothes!

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:14.030
Eh, clothes for me?

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:15.300
That's right.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:15.410
Now is your time to shine, Akarin!

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:17.640
TODAY'S
MAIN CHARACTER!

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:19.580
You're the star, Akarin!

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:21.540
Akarin
Akarin~!

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:24.290
Kyouko-chan...

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:29.340
<i>She's going to help me stand out.</i>

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:32.720
Wait! I'm way too dazzling!

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:39.420
Yuru Yuri 10th Anniversary!

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:42.500
Yuru Yuri's 10th Anniversary...

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.890
is about to start!

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:54.490
Topsy-turvy

00:00:54.490 --> 00:00:55.980
Yuru Yuri!

00:00:55.980 --> 00:00:59.800
Topsy-turvy

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:00.810
Yuru Yuri!

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:07.980
All this time passes in the blink of an eye

00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:09.760
But these days of youth are still here,

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:10.980
joyful, fun and exciting

00:01:10.980 --> 00:01:13.400
Springtime, Summer, Autumn, Winter

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:14.820
One more time

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:15.970
One more time!

00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:17.990
There are also other things that catch our eye, that surprise us

00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:19.570
or make our blood run hot, or even,

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:21.260
maybe make our hearts go pounding

00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:24.680
May we be blessed forevermore with times like these,

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:26.230
our gracious Lord!

00:01:26.230 --> 00:01:30.580
Decades may pass, but we will still certainly say

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:33.730
We can forever, forever

00:01:33.730 --> 00:01:36.280
forever and on, and always...

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:38.700
hope that we will (hope that we will)

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:41.720
have even more fun!

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:42.720
Topsy-turvy

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:44.980
For now and the coming days

00:01:44.980 --> 00:01:47.730
continuing on and on,

00:01:47.730 --> 00:01:52.750
Anywhere we are, we'll have happy days!

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:57.630
Through the next week and following weeks

00:01:57.630 --> 00:02:02.660
We'll even, even take on the next year and years after

00:02:02.660 --> 00:02:07.270
Let's walk onward together and forever

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:09.920
I truly

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:10.520
love you all!

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:14.300
Topsy-turvy

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:15.530
Yuru Yuri!

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:25.480
What are you all doing...?

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:26.900
We're playing caveman.

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:31.460
We wanted to reminisce about the last ten years, but we ended up rewinding too far.

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:32.780
But it was fun, wasn't it?

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:39.920
C-Calm down!

00:06:43.860 --> 00:06:44.750
I see.

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:50.530
It's the 10th anniversary,
so you wanted to do something special.

00:06:50.530 --> 00:06:53.200
Even so, why cavemen?!

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:56.160
When I saw you I was given a Scarimanjaro startle!

00:06:57.440 --> 00:06:58.400
Scar-Scarimanjaro...

00:06:58.400 --> 00:07:00.100
Rather than doing something strange,
Scar-Scarimanjaro...

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:02.900
couldn't we just have a proper party?

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:07.230
A party, huh?

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:09.610
Seems kind of ordinary.

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:19.220
Yeah, a party would be nice. A gaudy one.

00:07:19.220 --> 00:07:21.360
Around three days from now.

00:07:21.360 --> 00:07:25.040
Wouldn't it? That's a much better idea than doing something weird.

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:27.340
Ah, a party!

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:29.460
I love parties!

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:32.300
We'll decorate, and bring sweets and things like that,

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:35.320
and invite Hima-chan and Saku-chan, too!

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:36.810
Hey, don't just...

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:37.810
Himawari
Please let me come, too.
YA~Y ! I want to party~!
Sakurako

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:41.660
Sakurako-chan and Himawari-chan said they'll come.

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:42.880
That was quick!

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:45.380
Ayano-chan and I will come, too.

00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:46.320
Chitose!

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:51.740
As vice-president, you have to watch and keep them from getting too carried away.

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:54.700
Certainly, in that case...

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:57.740
It's A~ka~firmed!

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:06.380
How to make cookies?

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:07.620
Yeah!

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:10.010
I thought I would bring them to the party the day after next.

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:12.660
Do you have any free time after this?

00:08:17.380 --> 00:08:18.900
All right.

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:20.120
I was also thinking about preparing something.

00:08:20.120 --> 00:08:21.660
Akari-chan! Let's go home together!

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:22.640
Hooray! Thank you!
Akari-chan! Let's go home together!

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:23.760
Sure!
Hooray! Thank you!

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:28.540
First let's sift through the pastry flour.

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:29.360
OK!

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:34.760
Like this, sensei?

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:37.520
It's embarrassing to be addressed that way.

00:08:39.940 --> 00:08:41.980
Ah! Looking good.

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:42.870
Really?

00:08:44.060 --> 00:08:46.500
What is this? Delicious!

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:50.280
Chinatsu-chan, you're so delicate. Marry me!

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:02.800
OK, next can you mix this for me?

00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:03.930
Leave it to me!

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:09.040
Chinatsu-han!

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:11.190
All right!

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:16.450
I've got to work hard and turn these into delicious cookies so I can make Yui-senpai happy!

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:18.200
10 minutes later

00:09:19.560 --> 00:09:21.950
Look, look! It's thoroughly mixed.

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:23.950
Really?

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:31.130
<i>What on Earth could have happened in such a short amount of time?</i>

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:34.580
I-I'm just going to borrow this for a little bit.

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:35.380
OK!

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:37.130
10 minutes later
Another

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:41.820
<i>I somehow managed to get it back into a decent state.</i>

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:44.760
Next I've just got to use this to roll the dough, right?

00:09:44.760 --> 00:09:45.600
Yes.

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:47.190
Here I go!

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:48.080
There!

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:55.240
<i>All she did was roll it out, so why...?</i>

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:56.990
10 minutes later
Yet another

00:09:58.990 --> 00:10:02.760
<i>Yoshikawa-san really can't be underestimated.</i>

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:06.360
W-Well then, next you cut the dough into shapes.

00:10:06.360 --> 00:10:07.500
Leave it to me!

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:09.380
Just wait, Yui-senpai~!

00:10:10.900 --> 00:10:12.630
Chinatsu-han!

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:13.880
That's one!

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:16.740
It's so cute!

00:10:18.820 --> 00:10:20.870
This is a magic trick at this point!

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:28.140
So then, Kyouko-chan and Yui-chan are saying we should play a game in the club room, but...

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:30.960
Sakurako-chan! Akari-chan!

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:32.360
That's Chinatsu-chan's voice.

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:36.780
I smell cookies!

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:40.280
Welco—Ugh...!

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:46.760
Wow, amazing...

00:10:46.760 --> 00:10:48.860
They turned out cute, didn't they?

00:10:48.860 --> 00:10:51.540
Sakurako-chan, have a taste!

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:10.240
Chinachu!

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:10.750
Chu!

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:11.640
Chinachu!

00:11:11.640 --> 00:11:12.220
Chu!

00:11:12.220 --> 00:11:13.160
Chinachu!

00:11:13.160 --> 00:11:13.980
Chu! Chu! Chu!!

00:11:14.920 --> 00:11:17.230
Sakurako-chan, how is it?

00:11:19.960 --> 00:11:21.990
I can see the love...

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:26.990
the next day

00:11:30.550 --> 00:11:32.620
Look, look, Himawari.

00:11:33.340 --> 00:11:34.770
What are you showing me?

00:11:35.470 --> 00:11:37.540
You damn pair of breasts!

00:11:37.540 --> 00:11:39.090
Please stop it!

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:42.920
Chinatsu-chan, would you get me the masking tape?

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:44.260
Here, Yui-senpai!

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:46.420
Look, look!

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:49.040
Ah! Yours is cute!

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:51.440
Yours is cute, too, Akaza-san!

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:02.560
Looks like you're having a tough time, Ayano!

00:12:02.560 --> 00:12:03.990
Give it to me.

00:12:14.660 --> 00:12:16.170
That's about the size of it!

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:17.690
There you go.

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:23.550
Slide.

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:28.080
Cleaning up afterwards is important, too.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:31.560
Let's pop the balloons together.

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:35.780
Seriously, what a great party!

00:12:35.780 --> 00:12:38.080
Uh, the party's tomorrow.

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:45.240
All right, the preparations are complete.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:48.120
I'm expecting great things from the food, too, Yui-kun.

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:49.330
Yeah, yeah.

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:52.300
Well then, shall we call it a day?

00:12:52.300 --> 00:12:53.720
Yeah.

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:55.160
Ah, that's right.

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:59.240
I forgot something in the classroom, so go on ahead without me.

00:12:59.240 --> 00:13:01.620
Akari-chan's such a scatterbrain!

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:04.050
You're one to talk.

00:13:11.260 --> 00:13:13.480
Now that I've gotten what I forgot...

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:17.730
I'm going to decorate even more!

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:21.660
Akaza-san, you're really fired up, huh?

00:13:21.660 --> 00:13:23.070
Ah, Senpai!

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:25.680
You didn't go home with everyone?

00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:27.450
You got me kind of curious.

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:33.340
Um, I wanted to decorate a bunch more and make everyone even happier.

00:13:33.340 --> 00:13:36.400
All right, in that case I'll help, too.

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:38.670
Thank you very much!

00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:41.170
Let's make everything super gorgeous.

00:13:42.140 --> 00:13:42.920
Yeah!

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:51.140
Happy 10th Anniversary!

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:53.280
They look delicious!

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:57.820
Eat up, eat up!

00:13:57.820 --> 00:14:00.260
Haven't the decorations gotten more extravagant?

00:14:00.260 --> 00:14:03.480
Akaza-san and I stayed afterwards and did it together.

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:06.600
We wanted everyone to be happy with it, so we worked really hard.

00:14:06.600 --> 00:14:08.120
Is that so?

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:10.020
Thanks, both of you.

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:10.910
We made it!

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:14.240
Since you all like it, I'm happy, too.

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:18.240
Yui-senpai, here, have some. My China-cookies!

00:14:18.240 --> 00:14:21.000
Th-Thanks, Chinatsu-chan.

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:25.060
Chinachu!

00:14:25.060 --> 00:14:25.840
Mwah!

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:26.900
China-chama!

00:14:26.900 --> 00:14:27.440
Mwah!

00:14:27.440 --> 00:14:28.720
Chi-Cha-MWAH!

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:33.080
I can see something...

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:35.720
That's the form of our future together!

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:42.740
Himawari-chan, the macarons you made are delicious.

00:14:42.740 --> 00:14:46.360
I made plenty, so eat up.

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:50.000
I sure do like Funami-senpai's pie.

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:52.160
It's on a totally different level from Himawari's twin "pies."

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:53.840
What exactly is that supposed to mean?

00:14:53.840 --> 00:14:54.990
What's your problem?

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:01.420
Come to think of it, where is Toshinou-san?

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:03.600
Now that you mention it, she isn't here, is she?

00:15:03.600 --> 00:15:05.780
She slipped out quietly a little while ago.

00:15:05.780 --> 00:15:08.030
Where did she go?

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:16.310
Wh-What happened, Kyouko-chan?!

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:20.060
I took the occasion to give myself a makeover.

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:21.440
Does it suit me?

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:26.610
Her head!

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:29.400
Sakurako, that's a wig.

00:15:29.520 --> 00:15:30.360
A wig?

00:15:30.850 --> 00:15:32.740
What's with that?

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:34.870
What's a party without cosplay?

00:15:35.340 --> 00:15:36.120
Ta-da!

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:38.540
I brought one with Yui's hairstyle as well!

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:39.640
Why?

00:15:40.560 --> 00:15:42.340
All right, I'm going straight in!

00:15:42.340 --> 00:15:44.880
Gimme a funny man, gimme a funny man!

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:47.980
Yui-senpai doesn't say things like that!

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:49.900
Whoa! It's the Yui Police!

00:15:51.820 --> 00:15:54.200
Let's all put them on, like this!

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:56.760
Ah, sounds like fun.

00:15:58.040 --> 00:16:00.460
Eh, what's with this ostentatious one?

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:01.640
Yo! Big Sis!

00:16:03.700 --> 00:16:06.160
Yui-senpai, how is it?

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:08.030
B-Bob cuts also suit you, huh?

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:12.040
I-Isn't this a little over-the-top?

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:13.490
It actually suits you pretty well.

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:17.580
How do I look?

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:19.660
You chose that one without hesitation...

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:25.480
Why is something like this the only one left?

00:16:25.480 --> 00:16:28.170
I really, really wanted something else.

00:16:30.200 --> 00:16:31.700
What do you think, Himawari?

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:34.300
Everyone seems to be having a wonderful time.

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:36.000
Y-Yeah.

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:40.060
Hey, hey, you two put some on as well.

00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:46.440
Toshinou Kyouko...

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:50.520
Whoa! That's good, Ayano! It suits you, it suits you.

00:16:50.520 --> 00:16:53.780
W-Well of course it does!

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:58.030
Ayano-chan, look, look. This is a daring design, isn't it?

00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:03.340
When a girl looks like that, no-one would blink even if I got a nosebleed.

00:17:03.340 --> 00:17:05.500
No, don't start bleeding.

00:17:05.860 --> 00:17:08.380
All right! Let's take a photo together!

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:09.900
Timer, set!

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:12.420
Here we go!

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:14.110
OK, cheese!

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:20.100
Next let's play this!

00:17:20.140 --> 00:17:21.350
IMITATION GAME
NARIKIRI

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:25.380
Sakurako, could it be that's—

00:17:26.780 --> 00:17:28.100
In this game...

00:17:28.100 --> 00:17:28.110
<b>PROFESSION
CARD</b>

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:30.270
You choose any card you like,
then imitate someone of the designated profession.

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:33.360
<b>MAID</b>

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:34.180
You choose any card you like,
then imitate someone of the designated profession.

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:36.630
Moe, moe, kyun!

00:17:36.630 --> 00:17:38.660
Hey, why am I the one doing this?!

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:40.840
Sounds interesting.

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:43.040
Let's start right away!

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:46.920
Well then, I'll go first!

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:52.460
I'm now the assistant director!

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:53.480
Cut, cut!

00:17:53.480 --> 00:17:57.680
Sakurako, your boobs are a little too big, so switch out with someone else.

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:58.960
That's a wrap.

00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:02.180
All you're imitating is an incoherent person.

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:07.750
Very sad!

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:14.260
This patient is suffering from stupiditis.

00:18:14.260 --> 00:18:15.400
What did you say?!

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:17.420
I said, you're suffering from from stupiditis.

00:18:17.420 --> 00:18:17.950
All right, what about me?
I said, you're suffering from from stupiditis.

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:19.160
You talk too much!
All right, what about me?

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:20.160
What's your problem?

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:29.620
I-Is that a profession?

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:31.080
I got...

00:18:39.860 --> 00:18:42.420
I'm up next.

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:49.390
I've got it!

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:55.530
A home run by the lead-off hitter!

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:59.300
Game set! A crushing victory as the crowd goes Wyldoming wild!

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:01.160
Th-Those are some incredible rules...

00:19:04.060 --> 00:19:05.930
Nice! You're the perfect straight man!

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:08.410
Well done...

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:13.400
Sounds interesting, huh?

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:14.900
I'll pick a card, too.

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:18.120
Huh, I got the same one?

00:19:18.120 --> 00:19:19.840
I don't play the straight man much.

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:23.720
Ikeda-senpai, go ahead and do it to me!

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:31.290
Do it!

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:35.320
Wh-Why are you making such a face?

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:37.980
She's cute.

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:41.490
Then, I'll wrap this up!

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:45.740
<i>In this game, there are duplicate cards.</i>

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:48.910
<i>If Toshinou-san happens to draw the Doctor card...</i>

00:19:50.280 --> 00:19:52.000
OK, I'm going to do the examination.

00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:59.010
You might be sick.

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:02.760
Yes, I'm sick with love.

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:04.670
<i>It's coming!</i>

00:20:04.670 --> 00:20:06.600
<i>A bloody tsunami!</i>

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:09.290
I'm a video streamer!

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:10.280
What the heck?!

00:20:10.280 --> 00:20:12.730
Why can she do it so well now?

00:20:12.730 --> 00:20:15.230
Vroom, vroom! Hello, YuriTube!

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:17.480
Now then, everyone,

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:22.240
I thought up an idea for suitably crowning our festivities!

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:26.910
I call it "high-energy rock-paper-scissors!"

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:31.410
The people who lose at rock-paper-scissors have to get more and more enthusiastic by degrees.

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:33.280
What the heck is that?

00:20:33.280 --> 00:20:35.670
Sounds fun, sounds fun! Let's do it!

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:38.500
Alrighty, here we go! Rock, paper—

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:39.500
scissors!

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:42.520
Aww, I lost.

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:46.160
OK, Akari, pump your energy up one level higher than usual.

00:20:49.400 --> 00:20:50.520
Yo!

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:51.850
Are you all feeling excited?

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:53.300
Whoo!

00:20:53.300 --> 00:20:54.920
Bring on the rock-paper-scissors!

00:20:54.920 --> 00:20:56.520
<i>That's pretty enthusiastic.</i>
Bring on the rock-paper-scissors!

00:20:57.080 --> 00:21:00.030
Next round! Rock, paper—

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:01.030
scissors!

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:02.280
Hooray!

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:03.780
Akari-chan lost again, huh?

00:21:09.740 --> 00:21:12.790
Haha, I really blew that one!

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:15.540
Okay, let's get on to the next round!

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:17.940
Don't you guys want to play rock-paper-scissors!

00:21:17.940 --> 00:21:19.380
I-I do...

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:20.670
Of course you do!

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:24.010
Hey, I feel the same way!

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:29.930
Ro-ro-ro-r-r-r-r-rock, paper—

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:30.930
scissors!

00:21:37.350 --> 00:21:42.360
Why am I the only one who loses?

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:43.360
I wonder?!

00:21:44.580 --> 00:21:46.630
I-I wonder why...

00:21:46.630 --> 00:21:49.390
But consecutive losses can happen, after all...

00:21:49.390 --> 00:21:50.370
Yeah...

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:51.950
You know...

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:56.670
I want to see everyone else getting enthusiastic, too!

00:21:58.120 --> 00:21:59.440
Huh, huh, huh, huh?!

00:21:59.440 --> 00:22:02.880
Is it just me or have all of you become suspiciously low-energy?

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:04.340
H-Have we...?

00:22:04.340 --> 00:22:07.420
I mean, you haven't lost, so you aren't obliged to,

00:22:07.420 --> 00:22:10.320
but during club activities, you shouldn't get dispirited whenever you like!

00:22:10.320 --> 00:22:12.510
Isn't that—right?

00:22:13.740 --> 00:22:16.020
Y-Yeah. Sorry.

00:22:16.310 --> 00:22:18.460
Sh-Should we keep going like this?

00:22:18.460 --> 00:22:20.290
Maybe not...

00:22:20.290 --> 00:22:20.700
Uh, hey—

00:22:20.700 --> 00:22:25.500
All right, listen up, let's go!

00:22:25.500 --> 00:22:27.030
Rock, paper—

00:22:27.030 --> 00:22:28.050
scissors!

00:22:29.400 --> 00:22:31.860
Losing is fun!

00:22:31.860 --> 00:22:35.240
Something like this makes you go that little extra quick-quick-whoo-hoo!

00:22:35.240 --> 00:22:35.480
Quick-quick-whoo-hoo!

00:22:35.480 --> 00:22:37.460
She must be at her limit, right...?
Quick-quick-whoo-hoo!

00:22:37.460 --> 00:22:39.540
Sakurako-chan!

00:22:39.540 --> 00:22:41.640
You don't look like you're having fun!

00:22:41.640 --> 00:22:44.550
That's so totally rare! Let's pump you up!

00:22:44.550 --> 00:22:46.740
Are you ready?!

00:22:46.740 --> 00:22:47.920
Y-Yeah...

00:22:47.920 --> 00:22:50.930
Then let's continue!

00:22:53.100 --> 00:22:55.440
I lost again, I tell you, again!

00:22:55.440 --> 00:22:59.020
If this keeps up, I'll be going to heaven!

00:23:15.120 --> 00:23:17.360
Huh? I...

00:23:19.660 --> 00:23:23.020
Could it be that I really...?

00:23:37.020 --> 00:23:39.020
That's...

00:23:41.060 --> 00:23:45.020
I'm the main character and it's our 10th anniversary...

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:48.380
I don't want everything to end for me!

00:23:50.500 --> 00:23:52.940
Akari-chan. Akari-chan!

00:23:54.760 --> 00:23:56.310
Sakurako-chan?

00:23:56.310 --> 00:24:00.040
Akari-chan, thanks for always hanging out with me.

00:24:00.040 --> 00:24:03.670
Rehearsing for our skit was hard, but it was fun, wasn't it?

00:24:05.780 --> 00:24:09.780
I started to admire you when I heard how you were

00:24:09.780 --> 00:24:12.840
watering the classroom plants every morning.

00:24:12.840 --> 00:24:17.100
I'm glad we were able to become close so soon after the entrance ceremony.

00:24:18.160 --> 00:24:20.350
I-Is this...?

00:24:20.350 --> 00:24:24.850
I was happy when you ate and enjoyed my picked vegetables.

00:24:24.850 --> 00:24:29.110
I'm sorry for scaring you that time when I was wearing a gas mask.

00:24:29.110 --> 00:24:36.100
When I talk to you, Akaza-san,
I'm wrapped in a warm, calm feeling.

00:24:36.100 --> 00:24:41.370
I would love to become even closer to you after this, too.

00:24:41.370 --> 00:24:43.450
You guys...

00:24:44.000 --> 00:24:45.650
Akari-chan.

00:24:45.650 --> 00:24:50.380
Akari-chan, you're too agreeable, and you worry me sometimes.

00:24:50.380 --> 00:24:55.890
So like I said back then, if anything ever happens, I'll help you, OK?

00:24:55.890 --> 00:24:57.890
Chinatsu-chan...

00:25:02.640 --> 00:25:05.340
Kyouko-chan, Yui-chan...

00:25:05.340 --> 00:25:08.040
Akari, look at this.

00:25:09.100 --> 00:25:12.900
Akari was crying like crazy that day,
we really had our hands full, didn't we?

00:25:12.900 --> 00:25:16.410
Although Akari wasn't the only one who cried.

00:25:16.410 --> 00:25:20.020
We told you to arrive early 'cause we'd wait for you at middle school.

00:25:20.020 --> 00:25:21.680
But instead you made us wait the whole year!

00:25:21.680 --> 00:25:23.620
That just stands to reason.

00:25:23.620 --> 00:25:27.100
But you came, so I'll forgive you.

00:25:27.100 --> 00:25:28.790
Kyouko-chan...

00:25:28.790 --> 00:25:31.800
Akari, please continue extending your kindness to us.

00:25:31.800 --> 00:25:33.400
And...

00:25:34.120 --> 00:25:36.510
Happy Birthday!

00:25:43.060 --> 00:25:48.220
Akarin
Happy Birthday

00:25:48.220 --> 00:25:49.980
Huh?
Akarin
Happy Birthday

00:25:51.520 --> 00:25:54.560
Weren't we supposed to be having a 10th anniversary party...?

00:25:59.280 --> 00:26:02.040
Happy Birthday, Akari-chan!

00:26:04.760 --> 00:26:07.540
That's right, today's your birthday.

00:26:07.540 --> 00:26:11.800
When Ayano suggested that we hold a flashy party,

00:26:11.800 --> 00:26:15.050
it hit me that we could celebrate your birthday, too!

00:26:15.050 --> 00:26:18.020
As expected, Yui came around to the idea quickly.

00:26:18.020 --> 00:26:19.600
Isn't that how it always goes?

00:26:19.600 --> 00:26:20.550
Akari-chan!

00:26:20.550 --> 00:26:22.560
Happy Birthday!

00:26:24.720 --> 00:26:26.560
G-Guys...

00:26:28.560 --> 00:26:32.340
All of us, really treasure you, Akaza-san.

00:26:32.340 --> 00:26:33.320
Senpai...

00:26:33.320 --> 00:26:35.680
Looks like the surprise succeeded.

00:26:35.680 --> 00:26:37.820
I told you at the start, didn't I, Akari?

00:26:37.820 --> 00:26:40.320
You're the star!

00:26:45.580 --> 00:26:47.830
I'm so happy!

00:26:47.830 --> 00:26:51.840
Please keep being kind to me from now on, too!

00:26:51.840 --> 00:26:57.110
Twenty years from now,
thirty years from now,

00:26:57.110 --> 00:26:59.620
together forever and ever!

00:30:42.620 --> 00:30:47.240
Hey, there's something that's been bothering me.

00:30:47.240 --> 00:30:51.380
The slide show yesterday,
I'm surprised you had so many photos of me.

00:30:51.380 --> 00:30:52.240
Ah, that...

00:30:52.240 --> 00:30:57.060
There was someone who was glad to help us out after we explained the situation.

00:30:58.600 --> 00:30:59.960
Who could that be?

00:31:07.000 --> 00:31:08.220
How nice.

00:31:08.860 --> 00:31:11.220
It seems the surprise party was a success.

00:31:11.220 --> 00:31:14.850
If Akari was happy with it, that's all that matters.

00:31:14.850 --> 00:31:19.940
Oh, Akari, thank you for being born!

00:31:19.940 --> 00:31:23.750
Ha-lle-lu-jah!

00:31:27.240 --> 00:31:31.820
Now, now, it's rude to ask a magician to reveal her tricks.

00:31:32.440 --> 00:31:34.440
She's right.

00:31:34.780 --> 00:31:36.870
Well then.

00:31:37.780 --> 00:31:39.870
Let's do something!
